-- THE HAMLETS ARE LIVED IN (rome, 2026-11-04). Mig 370 built the two hamlets
-- empty; this fills them to their ground's own density, measured on the live
-- world: the Crossing 105 spawns in 239 rooms (0.44 a room, 13 for 29 rooms),
-- the mountain 257 in 402 (0.64, 19). Then the rats on top (rome: the villages
-- are rat-heavy, an easy meal the hunters around them come in for): twelve in
-- each, in the streets, yards and houses; the rest the region's own animals on
-- the fields and the common. Every row carries its own id (see mig 309).

